WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.563
Day 6. The bossy r.

2
00:00:02.013 --> 00:00:08.825
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.325 --> 00:00:15.226
When this letter comes after a vowel, it is bossy. It changes the sound. Here is the first team.

4
00:00:17.018 --> 00:00:18.637
And here is the second team.

5
00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:23.477
The word is car.

6
00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:28.614
The word is corn.

7
00:00:29.514 --> 00:00:34.070
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

8
00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:39.043
Read the first row of job one together. Your child reads the second row.

9
00:00:39.493 --> 00:00:43.526
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

10
00:00:43.976 --> 00:00:46.880
Find the team. What sound does it make? Then wait.

11
00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:53.253
For job two, press play for your child and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

12
00:00:53.703 --> 00:00:57.165
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
